x `=> `if x `== `0.0 then `1.0 else x
//│ = Lam([Symbol("x_5")], IfLike(If, Let(Symbol("scrut_1"), App(Builtin("=="), Tup([Ref(Symbol("x_5")), Lit(0)])), Cons(Branch(Ref(Symbol("scrut_1")), LitPattern(true), Else(Lit(1))), Else(Ref(Symbol("x_5")))))))

